SUMMARY:Deadline 21:59 EST: BIG Festival at gamescom latam 2027: free indie
  game submissions (Sao Paulo\, awards with cash prizes)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 15 Jan 2027 at 21:59 EST.\n\nBIG Festival\, the indie ga
 mes competition inside gamescom latam in Sao Paulo\, has opened free submi
 ssions for its 2027 edition. The 2026 edition drew a record 966 submission
 s from 75 countries.\n\nOrganisation: gamescom latam / BIG Festival\nLocat
 ion: Sao Paulo\, Brazil (Distrito Anhembi). Open to independent developers
  anywhere in the world.\nAward: Free submission and a no-cost exhibition s
 lot for selected games\, plus eligibility for the BIG Festival awards. 202
 7 prize amounts are not yet published\; in 2025 Best Game carried BRL 5\,0
 00 and in 2026 the WINGS Award carried EUR 2\,000 in cash.\nDuration: Subm
 issions 16 October 2026 to 15 January 2027\; festival 22 to 25 April 2027.
 \n\nMore: https://latam.gamescom.global/en/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugr
 antdesk&utm_medium=referral
